[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16083.469, "timestamp": "04:28:03", "text": "小孩，我可能會尖叫。我當時就想，「喔不，快"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16099.75, "timestamp": "04:28:19", "text": "嗯，我好像在Instagram上看過相關的帖子。 」 我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16112.309, "timestamp": "04:28:32", "text": "當時就想，「哦，哇。 」 兄弟，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16119.149, "timestamp": "04:28:39", "text": "不是這樣的。它和其他任何媒介一樣。這只是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16122.95, "timestamp": "04:28:42", "text": "講故事的一種方式。"}]